he agent is reporting reality or generating plausible-sounding noise.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/evidence-over-assertion.flexiarg", :sha256 "28425a05c4a87cbfe3147c1998e83701b8519b42c1796f1d0f25b4b039271248"}, :situation-source "M-stack-geometry.md references holistic-argument.sexp and holistic-argument-sketch.md.", :theory {:elems #{:i2}, :names {:i2 "Two predecessor argument files are named."}, :axioms #{}}}, :B {:text "    Require every substantive claim to point to evidence: a file path, a trace event, a test result, a quotation. If evidence is unavailable, emit the claim as provisional with an expiry and a verification path. Make \"unsupported claim\" a detectable violation, not just a style preference.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/evidence-over-assertion.flexiarg", :sha256 "28425a05c4a87cbfe3147c1998e83701b8519b42c1796f1d0f25b4b039271248"}, :situation-source "Mission cross-reference under the pattern’s file-anchor rule.", :theory {:elems #{:b}, :names {:b "Use both argument files as provenance for the superseded synthesis."}, :axioms #{}}}}, :maps {:a1 #{[:g :i1]}, :a2 #{[:g :i2]}, :b1 #{[:i1 :b]}, :b2 #{[:i2 :b]}}, :auxiliary {:b1 false, :b2 false}}} {:occurrence-id ["futon-theory/mission-lifecycle" 3], :pattern "futon-theory/mission-lifecycle", :roles ["contrast" "context"], :fragment-indices [], :origin :selected, :provenance {:reading-record-id "M-stack-geometry/M-stack-geometry/policy-c7d7518e1e185c2e2318/[\"futon-theory/mission-lifecycle\" 3]", :span {:start 266, :end 293}, :source-text-digest "9c2f467e8d5062961da62bae3a5d3b2b064f048a9354e7be0bfd5dfc025d2aad", :analysis-digest "e183844e1fd2569431413d615fb7b997a8182cdd0b86f14175ed3b83e21e5e4d", :source-sha256 "78eee0c50b9af03f21a6225c21799b5c724ae873dfd95aee9724be5aac787001", :square-digest "d99c1dcc6b6336cead6130d079894c8bfa3efd413121e018c3c981c746d93f20"}, :square {:schema :wm/three-halves-square-v1, :pattern "futon-theory/mission-lifecycle", :objects {:G {:text "    - Explicit 