enance.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/hdm/deep-storage-to-active-graph.flexiarg", :sha256 "5394a281f2def43f04a7643e1ad809a528edf3dfaaa38712902cced71475557f"}, :situation-source "Combined pattern and interface role.", :theory {:elems #{:b}, :names {:b "A provenance-preserving interface from stored pattern records to live boundary growth."}, :axioms #{}}}}, :maps {:a1 #{[:g :i1]}, :a2 #{[:g :i2]}, :b1 #{[:i1 :b]}, :b2 #{[:i2 :b]}}, :auxiliary {:b1 false, :b2 false}}, :fragment-indices [11], :pattern "hdm/deep-storage-to-active-graph"} {:pattern-rationale "The mechanics claim points to the exact documentation artifact where it can be checked.", :fragment-span {:start 1228, :end 1273}, :occurrence-id ["agent/evidence-over-assertion" 12], :roles ["dependency" "context"], :source-sha256 "28425a05c4a87cbfe3147c1998e83701b8519b42c1796f1d0f25b4b039271248", :sentence-id "s16", :blend-square {:schema :wm/three-halves-square-v1, :pattern "agent/evidence-over-assertion", :objects {:G {:text "    Evidence transforms agent output from \"trust me\" to \"check this.\" It enables verification, correction, and cumulative trust-building.\n\n    + evidence: Fulab PUR/PSR templates require anchors/certificates (`src/futon3/fulab/pattern_competence.clj`), and claim verification is enforced via `fulab-pattern-claim` + `fulab-pattern-check`.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/evidence-over-assertion.flexiarg", :sha256 "28425a05c4a87cbfe3147c1998e83701b8519b42c1796f1d0f25b4b039271248"}, :situation-source "Evidence rule applied to the mechanics reference.", :theory {:elems #{:g}, :names {:g "Evaluate a complete cascade by checking its AIF operations against the cited mechanics document."}, :axioms #{}}}, :I1 {:text "    The agent's outputs need to be verifiable by other agents, humans, or future selves.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/evidence-over-assertion.flexiarg", :sha256 "28425a05c4a87cbfe3147c1998e83701b8519b42c1796f1d0f25b4b039271248"}, :situation-source "agent/evi